WEBVTT

00:00:58.829 --> 00:01:02.537
Because such variations
existed long before humans,

00:01:02.579 --> 00:01:04.954
the witnesses claim the current
warming trend

00:01:04.954 --> 00:01:08.079
is also the result of natural variation.

00:01:08.288 --> 00:01:13.204
Ah, there is something more insufferable
than a commercial.

00:01:13.204 --> 00:01:17.746
Luckily for the humans, 
there’s one more expert witness.

00:01:25.996 --> 00:01:28.913
What are you looking at? 
We’re all dressed.

00:01:28.913 --> 00:01:32.121
At least we are by the logic 
you just used.